        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-emiliania-calcite-rosette-audit-v3-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-12>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-emiliania-calcite-rosette-audit-v3-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-13>,
