    dct:description "`--self-test` passes 12 checks in 2.7 s (8 Pass 2 + Voronoi/Euler consistency for F = 12/16/20, contact regime ordering / arrest / F_expose monotonicity / determinism, vesicle law round-trip / lambda = 1 circle / sim-vs-law / sub-pixel ellipticity / lambda* parity, Pass 3 JSON parity); default render is 5.7 s and deterministic (seed 2022); `lean` exits 0 on the 6-theorem file; the dataset README and the math-KG YAML are updated. Deductions: the new Pass 3 JSON is not SHA-pinned so a silent edit of its constants would not fail the integrity check (-4); the comparison PNG is gitignored, so the primary artifact is not committed and byte-identity across machines is not pinned (-3); the growth GIF is unchanged while the Pass 3 content lives only in a second GIF (-2); no requirements lock pins the numpy / scipy versions used here (-1)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/repro-package" ;
