        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-repro-package-4> ;
    pk1:hasScore 9e-01 ;
    pk1:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-source-traceability> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Young et al. (1992) & Jaya et al. (2016) Emiliania huxleyi V/R calcite crystal coccolith rosette shield & interlocking spherical coccosphere mechanics — Source and data traceability: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The dataset folder vendors the SHA-256-pinned specimen, reference JSON, scout manifest and bib verified fail-closed at runtime; the new `coccosphere_contact_vesicle_tension_reference.json` tags every constant `classical_formula` or `model_assumption` and states that no value is quoted from Jaya et al. (2016); `pass3_citations.bib` adds Reissner (1946) and the dataset README documents both Pass 3 extensions and their limits. Deductions: the new JSON is not SHA-256 pinned in EXPECTED_SHA256 / verify_dataset_integrity, so Pass 3 constants are not integrity-checked (-5); Jaya et al. (2016) is given the venue \"Nat. Commun. / J. Struct. Biol.\" and Walker et al. (2018) \"Nat. Commun. / New Phytol.\" with a Nat. Commun. DOI although the title is a New Phytologist paper — both pairs are internally inconsistent and could not be resolved offline (-6); the seed-paper DOI differs between the campaign record (10.1038/356145a0) and the script / bib (10.1038/356516a0, consistent with pp. 516-518) — unresolved offline (-3); the Reissner 1946 DOI is unverified (-2); the 12-taxon table carries no per-row citation for N_seg, w_0 or L_d (-2)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/source-traceability" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py L120–L146: verify_dataset_integrity: SHA-256 of specimen JPG, scout manifest and paper_citations.bib checked against the reference JSON; the Pass 3 JSON is not in the pinned set <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py#L120-L146>",
        "models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py L31–L46: Header citations: Jaya 2016 venue 'Nat. Commun. / J. Struct. Biol.', Walker 2018 'Nat. Commun. / New Phytol.' with DOI 10.1038/s41467-018-04168-9 — inconsistent venue/DOI pairs <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py#L31-L46>" ;
    pk1:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-source-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-source-traceability-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-source-traceability-3> ;
