<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-specimen-match> a pk1:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Young et al. (1992) & Jaya et al. (2016) Emiliania huxleyi V/R calcite crystal coccolith rosette shield & interlocking spherical coccosphere mechanics — Morphological realism / specimen match: 72/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The 3x3 figure shows the SEM overlay (Panel F) and the new Panel I places the relaxed vesicle rim over the SEM ellipse and the isotropic circle; the relaxed contour deviates from the best-fit ellipse by 0.20 % of a, below the 1.09 % one-pixel precision of the 92 x 78 px annotation, and the contact GIF renders the indentation cascade on the Voronoi sphere. Deductions: the ellipse centre, semi-axes, tilt and the pixel calibration are hand-annotated in the reference JSON and read by the segmentation function rather than detected, so the specimen b/a = 0.8478, e = 0.5303 and L_d = 3.50 um are transcriptions, and the Pass 3 lambda* is calibrated to the same annotation — only the N_seg = 32 DoG spoke count is measured from pixels (-14); the coccosphere panels compare with no micrograph of an indented or fractured coccosphere, so the slide-then-arrest sequence is matched to Jaya et al. (2016) only qualitatively (-8); the comparison PNG is gitignored (`*.png`) so the figure judged here is the regenerated one, not a committed artifact (-3); the growth GIF is unchanged from Pass 2 (-3)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
    pk1:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
    pk1:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
    pk1:evidenceAgainst "docs/media/emiliania_calcite_rosette_growth.gif (generated output, not in repo): 2-panel rosette growth GIF regenerated by the v3 script; content identical in design to Pass 2 (no vesicle / contact frames) — docs/media/emiliania_calcite_rosette_growth.gif: rendered output of models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py at 9987db7d, image/gif, 451866 B, 1122×505 px, 12 frames, artifact_sha256 1a3bb864fc8cd17bc03073d0fdad2d1bf6818f760dbc69b31edef22396129473 (sha256 1a3bb864fc8cd17bc03073d0fdad2d1bf6818f760dbc69b31edef22396129473), spec_fingerprint 965ae13d1916a73bad9dca346e9176f4f9220e85b7c520cf8b7bb71057d4f791",
        "models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py L1476–L1539: render_growth_gif unchanged from Pass 2; no Pass 3 content in the growth GIF <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py#L1476-L1539>",
        "models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py L994–L1078: segment_emiliania_coccolith_specimen: ellipse centre / semi-axes (L1013) / tilt / calibration come from JSON annotations; only the angular DoG spoke peaks are detected <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/9987db7d/models/2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py#L994-L1078>" ;
